@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Add a document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Refund Policy",
  "content": "We offer phone support 9-5 days a week."
}

### List documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents

### Ask a question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can I get a refund?"
}

### Ask a question that may not exist in context
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Do you offer phone support?"
}
